WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.740
And I realize that they did not know what they were doing

00:00:02.740 --> 00:00:04.060
when it came to construction

00:00:04.060 --> 00:00:07.180
and that their building concepts were so wrong.

00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:09.600
And the product that they were proposing to build

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:11.180
was so bad and so costly.

